l who cares deeply about others."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"NOTE: Measurements bases from in-game original presets, Everything, including name and except her personality is up to the Master to decide."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c86693"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e1/e11b2cfb4d42353f234f315708e630f61fb27673aec6825a39ddbd3f3abb3764.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cd/cde40c56c4056d34f7db2ac9b623f35f6e6cc21e3e1e502f1706705fdb732cb2.webp","width":241,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"佐倉 もも花","creatorId":"vndb:s267","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s267","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s267","name":"石原 愛依梨","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:83112","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c86694","characterName":"氷室 真冬","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c86694"},"originalCharacterName":"氷室 真冬","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"77"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"A"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"164"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"80"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"51"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"52"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A student council type of girl who is serious, uptight, and being intimate isn’t her thing."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Serious and proactive; little strict about rules and has leadership qualities."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although it is her weakness to be too serious and often unadaptable, she always tries to be sincere to anyone."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, she might not be good at dealing with unexpected troubles and accidents…"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In romantic relationships, she can never be honest about her feelings and often hesitates or gets passive."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She desires to like her passive self, and to love someone from all her heart."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From English Official Site"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"One of the three original or early employed Maids. A serious and hard working girl, very stoic at times much to her chagrin."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"NOTE: Measurements bases from in-game original presets, Everything, including name and except her personality is up to the Master to decide."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c86694"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1e/1e122723f08d1f661d681edcac27614158bec7bc47ca968590618391c124e079.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8c/8cbf8942f360cb09d0b93db9ecda24cc02fc774844330cc63d0e1018f0bf9e74.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"ヒマリ","creatorId":"vndb:s284","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s284","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s284","name":"朋永 真季","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:83114","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c86695","characterName":"滝沢 リサ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c86695"},"originalCharacterName":"滝沢 リサ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"93"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"G"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"171"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"90"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"60"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"56"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A mature, dignified woman who is usually cool, but sometimes gets sweet and friendly."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Speaks her own opinion; independent and mature lady."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Since she has an older-sister like quality, All men and women admire and depend on her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she is independent and mature, she is inexperienced with relationships, so she is not very knowledgeable about romances."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"It is not easy to get intimate with her, but she might show you her deep affection once you do…"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From English Official Site"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"One of the three original or early employed Maids. A mature and dignified young lady who is quite like an older sister to the other girls."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"NOTE: Measurements bases from in-game original presets, Everything, including name and except her personality is up to the Master to decide."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A Rindere is similar yet different to the common Coodere in that one still very much shows emotions, mostly with a mature, calm and strict attitude while in contrary to a Tsundere those emotions are not a facade. Of course the -dere part still very much means that they care."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c86695"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c9/c9f2e8c00400f0270c0def238bbc0416c88fc5051a0efda36909eff8c3945e5b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/22/22519d4d5b62c9d86ab550bd02d1f605e2e880683d2925de6f93bb2f9f98d1a6.webp","width":204,"height":256,"source